ss="flex-1"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-xl font-semibold text-white leading-snug mb-4">DataOps &amp; governance</h3><p class="hidden md:block text-[#D6DCFF] text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Streamline data pipelines and ensureenterprise-grade governance and compliance</p><div class="mt-4 w-10 h-[2px] bg-[#8B9CFF] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="md:py-8 py-10" id="case-studies"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 xl:px-20"><div class="flex gap-6 items-center mb-1 md:mb-2"><p class="inline-flex items-center rounded-r-full bg-[#2E3092] px-3 py-1 text-[14px] md:text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-white" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)">Case studies</p></div><div class="pt-2" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(-100px)"><h2 class="text-xl md:text-4xl font-semibold bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#2E3092_75%,#ED1C24_100%)] bg-clip-text text-transparent lg:leading-[3.1rem]">Benchmarking AI infrastructure for<br/> genome sequencing workloads</h2><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-12 items-stretch" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><div class=" text-white p-4 md:p-8 rounded-[20px] w-full h-70  md:w-2/3 flex flex-col justify-center bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image:url(/_next/static/media/dell-benchmarking-case.cc6a6bba.jpg);opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px)"></div><div class="  md:w-2/3 flex flex-col justify-between"><div><p class="text-[#959595] text-sm md:text-[15px] font-light p-2" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">Traditional genome sequencing can take hours or days to generate insights. Calsoft engineered and benchmarked an AI-powered genome sequencing platform on Dell PowerEdge XE9680 and XE7740 servers powered by Intel Gaudi AI accelerators, enabling faster analysis, optimized AI training and inference, and scalable performance for real-world genomics workloads. </p><div class="flex flex-nowrap gap-3 mt-6 md:mt-10"><a href="/insights/case-studies/ai-powered-genome-sequencing-benchmarking-dell-infrastructure" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="relative flex w-[150px] md:w-[180px] h-[48px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full shadow-md bg-[#BA0007] text-white transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden group"><span class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm md:text-base group-hover:text-[#BA0007]">See the results<svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="text-2xl" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M464 256c0-114.87-93.13-208-208-208S48 141.13 48 256s93.13 208 208 208 208-93.13 208-208zm-224 80.09L303.58 272H154v-32h149.58L240 175.91l22.71-22.54L364.54 256 262.7 358.63z"></path></svg></span><span class="absolute inset-0 bg-white w-full h-full left-0 -translate-x-full transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-0"></span></a><a href="/insights/case-studies" class="flex w-[170px] md:w-[220px] h-[48px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#2E3092] text-[#2E3092] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#2E3092] hover:text-white"><span class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm md:text-base">Explore Case Studies<span class="text-lg">➔</span></span></a></div></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/3"><div class="block md:hidden "><div class="swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg flex items-center space-x-2 my-2" style="box-shadow:0px 1px 9px 0px #D9DBF1;opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px)"><p class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700">98%</p><div class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-tight px-2">Improved model accuracy</div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg flex items-center space-x-2 my-2" style="box-shadow:0px 1px 9px 0px #D9DBF1;opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px)"><p cl